    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. some of the people at the meeting are pretty upset though, calling it \"density at the expense of community\" and saying it'll ruin the character of the neighborhood. how should i address those kinds of arguments so they don't derail the whole presentation?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
